<title>SPAIN: WATER POLO-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>WATER POLO-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Water polo results from the fifth</p>
<p>day of the European Championships on Sunday:</p>
<p>Women's preliminary rounds</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>France beat Czech Republic 14-7 (2-2 4-2 2-2 6-1)</p>
<p>Greece beat Germany 7-5 (3-4 2-0 1-1 1-0)</p>
<p>Hungary beat Yugoslavia 15-1 (3-0 6-0 2-1 4-0)</p>
</text>
